{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally in the UK", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "London Is Great!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Exploring Ancient Sites > Stonehenge", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about directions to places in  a limited range of social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Places and Location", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can ask about places with the question <span class=\"italic\">Where is \u2026 ?</span>  or <span class=\"italic\">Where is that?</span> <br><br>When you say where things are, you can use these expressions: <br><span class = \"italic\">It's not far from here</span>.<br><span class = \"italic\">It's located</span> ...<br><span class = \"italic\">Not too far from there is</span> ...", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Westminster is not far from here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They're all located within walking distance of each other.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Not too far from there is Tower Bridge.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Prepositions of Place", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you say where things are, you use prepositions of place like <span class=\"italic\">along, through, across, on</span> or <span class=\"italic\">at.</span>    <br><br> You walk <span class=\"strong\">along</span> a path, like a river. <br>You go <span class=\"strong\">through</span> a space, like a city. <br>A bridge goes <span class=\"strong\">across</span> a river.<br>Something is located <span class=\"strong\">on</span> a river bank.<br>You use <span class=\"strong\">at </span>to talk about a place, like a pub.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  I loved walking along the River Thames.<br> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Where is that? <br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It flows through the whole city.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "river ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "water that flows across land", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I loved walking along the River Thames.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le08ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when you visit London.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to perform ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to demonstrate a talent in public (act, sing, dance, etc.)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is where William Shakespeare performed his plays.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le08ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "theater ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a building where plays are performed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Globe is one of the world's most famous theaters.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le08ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "famous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "many people know about it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Not too far from there is Tower Bridge, a very famous bridge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le08ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "south bank", "type": "name"}, {"content": "one side of a river", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Globe Theatre is on the south bank.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le08ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "reproduction", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a copy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's a reproduction of the theater where William Shakespeare performed his plays.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le08ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be located", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be in a place", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They're all located within walking distance of each other.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le08ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le08ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of an interesting place in your community or city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, discuss why it is interesting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain where it is. Use expressions and prepositions of place you learned in this lesson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner talks about a different place. Ask your partner questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss more places.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I discuss 2-3 interesting places in my community.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say where the places are located.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask my partner questions about places.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le08ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey Vanessa! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hi Sally!  How's it going in London?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  This city is great! It has so much history.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What did you like best?<br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le08ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "13000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  I loved walking along the River Thames. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Where is that?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It flows through the whole city. The Globe Theatre is across the river. It's on the south bank. It's one of the world's most famous theaters. It's a reproduction of the theater where William Shakespeare performed his plays. Not too far from there is Tower Bridge. It's a very famous bridge that crosses the Thames.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What do you want to see next?<br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le08ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "42000", "text": 